@@ -0,0 +1,78 @@
+/* Inline Functions for bool-array.{h,cc}.
+
+   Copyright (C) 1989-1998, 2002 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+   Written by Douglas C. Schmidt <schmidt@ics.uci.edu>
+   and Bruno Haible <bruno@clisp.org>.
