+ 1. Client calls `StreamingInputCall` again, sending the *compressed* message
+
+    ```
+    {
+      expect_compressed:{
+        value: true
+      }
+      payload:{
+        body: 27182 bytes of zeros
+      }
+    }
+    ```
+
+ 1. And finally, the *uncompressed* message
+    ```
+    {
+      expect_compressed:{
+        value: false
+      }
+      payload:{
+        body: 45904 bytes of zeros
+      }
+    }
+    ```
+
+ 1. Client half-closes
